Package: pve-file-restore-ntfs3g
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: junglivre <junglivre@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: initramfs-tools-core, pve-file-restore-ntfs3g-daemon (>= 2), pve-file-restore-ntfs3g-image (>= 3)
Description: NTFS-3G File Restore for Proxmox VE (metapackage)
 Pulls in the ntfs-3g-patched Proxmox File Restore packages
 (proxmox-backup-file-restore and proxmox-backup-restore-image) through their
 versioned feature-level virtual package names, so an unpatched official
 package or an incompatible independently released component can never
 satisfy this dependency.
 .
 Also installs /usr/sbin/pve-file-restore-ntfs3g-check, which verifies that
 the patch is active on this node (use --json for machine-readable output).
